      "movesets": [
        {
          "name": "Calm Mind + Taunt",
          "pokemon": "Arceus-Grass",
          "shiny": false,
          "gender": "DC",
          "levels": [],
          "description": "<p>Arceus-Grass is a potent stallbreaker and sweeper in Ubers UU thanks to its excellent bulk and decent typing enabling it to repeatedly Calm Mind. Taunt blocks common anti-setup measures like Roar from <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/solgaleo/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Solgaleo</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/giratina/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Giratina</a> and Encore from <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/magearna/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Magearna</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/ogerpon-hearthflame/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Ogerpon-H</a>, allowing Arceus-Grass to stack massive amounts of boosts. Recover allows Arceus-Grass to check Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palafin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palafin</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palkia-origin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palkia-O</a> throughout the course of the game, as well as giving it multiple attempts to sweep. Tera Poison grants Arceus-Grass a resistance to Poison-type attacks from Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/sneasler/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Sneasler</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-poison/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Poison</a>, along with removing its other weaknesses like to Ice- and Fire-type moves from <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/kyurem-white/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Kyurem-W</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/chi-yu/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Chi-Yu</a>. Alternatively, Tera Fairy can be opted for, as its ability to block Dragon Tail from the likes of <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/dialga/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Dialga</a> and Giratina removes some of the only defensive counterplay to Arceus-Grass that's not covered by Taunt. Arceus-Grass is forced out by foes like Ogerpon-H, Tera Fire <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zacian/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zacian</a>, and Dragon Dance Arceus-Poison, so Pokemon that can handle these threats like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/toxapex/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Toxapex</a>, Giratina, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/landorus-therian/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Landorus-T</a> are excellent partners. Arceus-Grass can check Pokemon like Palkia-O, Palafin, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/landorus/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Landorus</a> for its teammates, which Pokemon like Chi-Yu, Solgaleo, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zamazenta-crowned/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zamazenta-C</a> appreciate. Arceus-Grass can struggle to break through Grass-resistant foes like Dialga and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/slowking-galar/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Galarian Slowking</a>, so Pokemon like Chi-Yu and Landorus that can remove them pair excellently with it.</p>",
